sor ask a customer first?","ar":"قبل الاستماع. ماذا يسأل مستشار الخدمة الزبون أوّلاً؟"},"id":"L001"},{"actor":"rana","start":12.538,"text":{"en":"How can I help you. Listen for it.","ar":"كيف يمكنني مساعدتك. استمع إليها."},"id":"L002"},{"actor":"rana","start":16.934,"text":{"en":"Good morning, welcome to Cham Motors. How can I help you?","ar":"صباح الخير، أهلاً بك في شام موتورز. كيف يمكنني مساعدتك؟"},"id":"L003"},{"actor":"aboud","start":22.674,"text":{"en":"My car needs a service.","ar":"سيارتي تحتاج إلى صيانة."},"id":"L004"},{"actor":"rana","start":26.494,"text":{"en":"Of course. What is the problem?","ar":"بالطبع. ما المشكلة؟"},"id":"L005"},{"actor":"aboud","start":30.626,"text":{"en":"It is making a noise, and the service is due.","ar":"تصدر صوتاً، وموعد الصيانة حان."},"id":"L006"},{"actor":"rana","start":35.934,"text":{"en":"I will write a job card. Can you leave the car with us today?","ar":"سأكتب بطاقة عمل. هل يمكنك ترك السيارة عندنا اليوم؟"},"id":"L007"},{"actor":"aboud","start":41.53,"text":{"en":"Yes. When will it be ready?","ar":"نعم. متى ستكون جاهزة؟"},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"rana","start":46.238,"text":{"en":"This afternoon. We will call you.","ar":"بعد الظهر. سنتّصل بك."},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"rana","start":50.586,"text":{"en":"What does his car need?","ar":"ماذا تحتاج سيارته؟"},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"rana","start":56.811,"text":{"en":"A service. He said, my car needs a service.","ar":"صيانة. قال: سيارتي تحتاج إلى صيانة."},"id":"L011"},{"actor":"rana","start":62.143,"text":{"en":"When will the car be ready?","ar":"متى ستكون السيارة جاهزة؟"},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"rana","start":68.675,"text":{"en":"This afternoon. Rana will call him.","ar":"بعد الظهر. رانا ستتّصل به."},"id":"L013"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"ac498f7d405df230","bytes":30528,"sha":"42b0939f77e6a009","address":"lines/ac498f7d405df230.mp3"},{"key